優勝ﾁｰﾑは ﾗｲﾄﾞｱｳﾄだ！}The winner of the National Team Tournament is Rideout!

00:01:03.380 --> 00:01:04.220
{(ｼｭｳ)立て ﾊﾞﾙﾄ｡}Get up, Valt.

00:01:05.110 --> 00:01:05.730
{立て！}Get up!

00:01:08.440 --> 00:01:10.980
{＜ まだ俺には個人戦がある！＞}But there's still the Solo Tournament!

