<i>atsuku hajike, takanariau</i>

00:02:09.510 --> 00:02:11.550
<i>(3, 2, 1! Go Shoot!)</i>

00:02:09.510 --> 00:02:11.550
<i>(3, 2, 1! Go Shoot!)</i>

